{"data": [{"attachments": {"poll_ids": ["2113147243209609216"]}, "author_id": "2068518641511911424", "created_at": "2026-10-22T05:55:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113147247890452953"], "id": "2113147247890452953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有个疑问\n\n再过两个月就到2027年了\n\n2025年出生人口792万\n\n今年出生人口是否会再创新低？", "url": "https://x.com/YY6bro/status/2113147247890452953"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113175525166604289"]}, "author_id": "1775703147635441665", "created_at": "2026-10-22T17:33:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113322742938325351"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hx1MCgwbP0", "end": 65, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Chenfacai0/status/2113322742938325351/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113175525166604289", "start": 42, "url": "https://t.co/hx1MCgwbP0"}]}, "id": "2113322742938325351", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 260, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "堕胎人次数是出生人口数的1.5倍，也就是1000万出生人口数对应1500万堕胎数。 https://t.co/hx1MCgwbP0", "url": "https://x.com/Chenfacai0/status/2113322742938325351"}, {"author_id": "1788870098457133056", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:39:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113626457339728254"], "id": "2113626457339728254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 279, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "表态了！\n\n中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模\n\n中国总理李强召开国务院常务会议，提出要持续积累和释放人口总和红利，优化面向家庭的社保和住房等举措，努力“稳定新出生人口规模”。", "url": "https://x.com/DangcingAI/status/2113626457339728254"}, {"author_id": "1966924987425845250", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:29:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113608829003043002"], "id": "2113608829003043002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模", "url": "https://x.com/SlowLijiang/status/2113608829003043002"}, {"author_id": "1961694254797029376", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:42:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113642164433608919"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "中国总理李强召开国务院常务会议，提出要持续积累和释放人口总和红利，优化面向家庭的社保和住房等举措，努力“稳定新出生人口规模”。", "display_url": "zaobao.com.sg/news/china/sto…", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261023-9885891?utm_source=android-share&utm_medium=app", "images": [{"height": 500, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113642164916015104/vXicUPE3?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 909}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113642164916015104/vXicUPE3?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 18, "status": 200, "title": "中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模", "unwound_url": "https://www.zaobao.com.sg/news/china/story20261023-9885891?utm_source=android-share&utm_medium=app", "url": "https://t.co/WiwxolW2Sh"}]}, "id": "2113642164433608919", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国国常会：努力稳定新出生人口规模\nhttps://t.co/WiwxolW2Sh", "url": "https://x.com/foo_sjsj/status/2113642164433608919"}, {"author_id": "2108441099714834432", "created_at": "2026-10-23T20:42:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113732814248214533"], "id": "2113732814248214533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天国务院常务会议定了两件大事：统筹人口与经济社会发展、加力推进服务业扩能提质。\n· 人口：完善婚嫁生育养育教育政策，努力稳定新出生人口规模\n· 服务业：破解难点堵点，破除市场准入障碍，清理民间投资隐性壁垒", "url": "https://x.com/qiuqiu23126/status/2113732814248214533"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113622554871287808"]}, "author_id": "1491315935533096962", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:24:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113622570868289851"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5ThQ90tqEV", "end": 78, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/hongsv11/status/2113622570868289851/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113622554871287808", "start": 55, "url": "https://t.co/5ThQ90tqEV"}]}, "id": "2113622570868289851", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2055, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国常会\n\n根据人口分布情况优化基础设施布局，推动公共服务资源与常住人口变化动态适配\n\n努力稳定新出生人口规模 https://t.co/5ThQ90tqEV", "url": "https://x.com/hongsv11/status/2113622570868289851"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113570047301918720"]}, "author_id": "2087365277495218176", "created_at": "2026-10-23T09:55:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113570052452860281"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6ibi1Phxdp", "end": 92, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/squidbigface/status/2113570052452860281/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113570047301918720", "start": 69, "url": "https://t.co/6ibi1Phxdp"}]}, "id": "2113570052452860281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 251, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "总加速师会不会是支黑，要学吉克搞艾尔迪亚安乐死啊\n\n十年出生人口给你减个1000万，\n\n吉克：“从未降生于世，就是最大的幸福”\n\n太善了 https://t.co/6ibi1Phxdp", "url": "https://x.com/squidbigface/status/2113570052452860281"}, {"author_id": "1740353535055929344", "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:57:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113102308913639671"], "id": "2113102308913639671", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 745, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "官员腐败，\n失业率高企，\n房地产市场崩盘，\n出生人口断崖下滑，\n大学生就业率低于50%，\n在西方国家都会引发政府下台，\n在中国却没有一点波澜稳如泰山，\n这是为甚呢？？？为什么呢？？？", "url": "https://x.com/lidayou369/status/2113102308913639671"}, {"author_id": "1837502871438610432", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:13:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113650075503350133"], "id": "2113650075503350133", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国常会要加快建设生育友好型社会\n\n更好统筹人口与经济社会资源环境\n持续积累释放人口综合红利\n优化家庭财税社保住房支持\n努力稳定新出生人口规模\n\n出处：财联社、澎湃、联合早报\n\n红利要续，先把娃生得起养得起", "url": "https://x.com/zhuanqian678/status/2113650075503350133"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113703561607499776"]}, "author_id": "1138766381074268163", "created_at": "2026-10-23T18:46:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113703568243138563"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kpxwghTyrD", "end": 129, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HumanErrorCN/status/2113703568243138563/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113703561607499776", "start": 106, "url": "https://t.co/kpxwghTyrD"}]}, "id": "2113703568243138563", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "国常会又研究怎么稳住出生人口了。\n\n我就想问：有多少年轻人敢确定自己明年还有这份工作、还能负担现在的房租、孩子生下来有人带？\n\n这些都没着落，讨论生育意愿当然很难有结果。\n\n孩子不是指标，不能开完会就自动增长。 https://t.co/kpxwghTyrD", "url": "https://x.com/HumanErrorCN/status/2113703568243138563"}, {"author_id": "2109105200174915584", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:03:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113617367804924353"], "id": "2113617367804924353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "截至2025年底，中国16到59岁人口有约8.5亿。今天走出大学、进入职场的人，出生在二十多年前。现在少出生的孩子，很多还没有上小学。\n\n所以，我们会同时看到两个现象：一边是出生人口减少，一边是高校毕业生规模仍然很大。", "url": "https://x.com/xunkong2009/status/2113617367804924353"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113184163167682560"]}, "author_id": "1367943697279705090", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:37:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113181975536185648", "2113184169031258224", "2113184586058420525", "2113187760861331896", "2113188073093693728"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Fv2eLxh62H", "end": 183, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113188073093693728/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113184163167682560", "start": 160, "url": "https://t.co/Fv2eLxh62H"}]}, "id": "2113188073093693728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 67, "impression_count": 33046, "like_count": 184, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "中国社保2035年之前是不会崩盘的，习主席在位的时候不会。\n\n政府总有办法发养老金的。拆东墙补西墙，发债，提高社保缴费基数，把富人当水鱼宰…….有的是办法。\n\n80后开始大规模退休的时间是2035年，2040年代90后女性又开始陆续退休了，大家知道1980年代末期到1990年代的出生人口吗？\n\n1987年 2522万 https://t.co/Fv2eLxh62H", "url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113188073093693728"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113184163167682560"]}, "author_id": "1367943697279705090", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:22:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113181975536185648", "2113184169031258224", "2113184586058420525", "2113187760861331896", "2113188073093693728"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AKqXyxvNgE", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113184169031258224/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113184163167682560", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/AKqXyxvNgE"}]}, "id": "2113184169031258224", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "中国的社保是不会崩盘的，起码习主席在位的时候不会。\n\n政府总有办法发养老金的。拆东墙补西墙，发债，提高社保缴费基数，把富人当水鱼宰…….有的是办法。\n\n80后开始大规模退休的时间是2035年，2040年代90后女性又开始陆续退休了，大家知道1980年代末期到1990年代的出生人口吗？\n\n1987年 2522万 https://t.co/AKqXyxvNgE", "url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113184169031258224"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113184163167682560"]}, "author_id": "1367943697279705090", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:24:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113181975536185648", "2113184169031258224", "2113184586058420525", "2113187760861331896", "2113188073093693728"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zPiME8slPE", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113184586058420525/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113184163167682560", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/zPiME8slPE"}]}, "id": "2113184586058420525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 395, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国的社保是不会崩盘的，起码习主席在位的时候不会。\n\n政府总有办法发养老金的。拆东墙补西墙，发债，提高社保缴费基数，把富人当水鱼宰…….有的是办法。\n\n80后开始大规模退休的时间是2035年，2040年代90后女性又开始陆续退休了，大家知道1980年代末期到1990年代的出生人口吗？\n\n1987年 2522万 https://t.co/zPiME8slPE", "url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113184586058420525"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113184163167682560"]}, "author_id": "1367943697279705090", "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:36:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113181975536185648", "2113184169031258224", "2113184586058420525", "2113187760861331896", "2113188073093693728"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kpxIAAfEZ5", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113187760861331896/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113184163167682560", "start": 156, "url": "https://t.co/kpxIAAfEZ5"}]}, "id": "2113187760861331896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 171, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国社保2035年之前是不会崩盘的，起码习主席在位的时候不会。\n\n政府总有办法发养老金的。拆东墙补西墙，发债，提高社保缴费基数，把富人当水鱼宰…….有的是办法。\n\n80后开始大规模退休的时间是2035年，2040年代90后女性又开始陆续退休了，大家知道1980年代末期到1990年代的出生人口吗？\n\n1987年 https://t.co/kpxIAAfEZ5", "url": "https://x.com/BingLiu34173809/status/2113187760861331896"}, {"author_id": "1277172338144866309", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:28:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113668947472257195"], "id": "2113668947472257195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "私自身としては、人類が減る、または絶滅することを希求してはいません。\n新たに子が生産され、死への恐怖という経験を前提付ける行為に対する倫理的な疑いがあるのみであり、議論の対象は人口の減少ではなく、あくまで出生(人口増加)なのです。", "url": "https://x.com/antinatalise/status/2113668947472257195"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112834845936410624", "3_2112834879494975488"]}, "author_id": "1260553941714186241", "created_at": "2026-10-22T00:20:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113062779997630683"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pGWR03CO3E", "end": 161, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113062779997630683/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2112834845936410624", "start": 138, "url": "https://t.co/pGWR03CO3E"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pGWR03CO3E", "end": 161, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113062779997630683/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2112834879494975488", "start": 138, "url": "https://t.co/pGWR03CO3E"}, {"display_url": "x.com/whyyoutouzhele…", "end": 185, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2112831271701553636", "start": 162, "url": "https://t.co/upJz3Y2ZJ5"}]}, "id": "2113062779997630683", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 331, "impression_count": 335070, "like_count": 829, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 62, "retweet_count": 61}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112831271701553636", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "10月20日，有网友根据格隆汇发布的全国各省份不同孩次出生人口性别比数据，制作了一张以颜色深浅区分性别比高低的图表，直观展示各地一孩、二孩、三孩的性别比差异。\n而后，博文被微博平台转为仅自己可见，理由是“歪曲理解、恶意揣测、带节奏、攻击嘲讽社会话题，扰乱社会秩序的谣言等”。 https://t.co/pGWR03CO3E https://t.co/upJz3Y2ZJ5", "url": "https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113062779997630683"}, {"author_id": "2108441099714834432", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:43:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113657489912996028"], "id": "2113657489912996028", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天国常会的消息：加快建设生育友好型社会，优化家庭支持政策，努力稳定新出生人口规模。婚嫁、生育、养育、教育全链条政策继续完善，财税社保住房的支持也要跟上。\n\n说白了还是老问题——年轻人生不起、养不起，光喊口号没用。你们觉得什么样的支持政策是真有用的？直接发钱，还是先把育儿成本打下来？", "url": "https://x.com/qiuqiu23126/status/2113657489912996028"}, {"author_id": "1370394531833638916", "created_at": "2026-10-22T09:27:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113200486413479965"], "id": "2113200486413479965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2298, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "为什么广东人敢生娃，江浙沪却不敢？\n\n中国生育率最能打的经济第一大省，不是大家印象里的欠发达省份，而是连续35年GDP霸榜全国的广东！\n\n江浙沪的生育率现在一年比一年拉胯，像晒蔫的草；反观广东，连续7年出生人口断层第一，硬生生扛住了全国生育大盘的底线。", "url": "https://x.com/daxiniu1/status/2113200486413479965"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113125784403812352"]}, "author_id": "1976177027502731264", "created_at": "2026-10-22T04:30:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113125796961460247"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/J4Cer9bhrj", "end": 151, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/timinmg/status/2113125796961460247/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113125784403812352", "start": 128, "url": "https://t.co/J4Cer9bhrj"}]}, "id": "2113125796961460247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📉 中国出生人口持续下降：从2016年的1883万，到2025年的792万，十年间减少约58%。\n\n这不仅是人口数字的变化，更意味着教育、房地产、就业和养老产业都将迎来深刻调整。\n\n未来经济的竞争，不再只是人口数量的竞争，更是科技创新与劳动生产率的竞争。 https://t.co/J4Cer9bhrj", "url": "https://x.com/timinmg/status/2113125796961460247"}, {"author_id": "1362636470079528967", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:27:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113668599374307478"], "id": "2113668599374307478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 848, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个冷知识，2026年韩国上半年出生人口145804人，同比增长15%。\n\n韩国的高增长生育率说明一个问题，老百姓只要有钱，国家不用劝。\n\n咱们这边的生育率想起来，最基本的前提就是得让老百姓有钱。", "url": "https://x.com/Sizhe_bitcat/status/2113668599374307478"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113625955193466880"]}, "author_id": "1676130322294112256", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:37:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113625964966244516"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VCMLRuFXbQ", "end": 160, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PanXing0827/status/2113625964966244516/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113625955193466880", "start": 137, "url": "https://t.co/VCMLRuFXbQ"}]}, "id": "2113625964966244516", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 613, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "这段话什么意思？我给你们翻译一下！！\n\n“持续积累和释放人口综合红利，以人口高质量发展支撑经济社会高质量发展。”\n\n翻译：现有的人，潜力还没榨干！得继续挖掘，充分利用！\n\n“加快建设生育友好型社会，努力稳定新出生人口规模。”\n\n翻译：至于生不生、有没有人生，慢慢想办法吧！ https://t.co/VCMLRuFXbQ", "url": "https://x.com/PanXing0827/status/2113625964966244516"}, {"author_id": "1609897027709861888", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:09:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113634038955286931"], "id": "2113634038955286931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 382, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1、据财联社报道，国常会提出要加快建设生育友好型社会，优化面向家庭的财税、社保、住房等支持举措，努力稳定新出生人口规模。\n2、涉及个股：无直接对应个股，最贴近方向为母婴零售与家庭消费板块，可关注新华百货（600785）所属零售促销与IP经济方向。", "url": "https://x.com/SYU77996/status/2113634038955286931"}, {"author_id": "2013436454773379072", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:54:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113449061298610608"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TaoLongevity/s…", "end": 189, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TaoLongevity/status/2113447501877358629", "start": 166, "url": "https://t.co/ofm45lPbrp"}]}, "id": "2113449061298610608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 314, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113447501877358629", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "从\"我们\"到\"我\"\n\n一组数据，看清这个时代的变化：\n\n2026 年上半年，全国结婚登记 327.5 万对，同比下降约 7.46%，是 2014 年以来同期最低。\n2025 年全年出生人口 792 万，创 1949 年以来新低。\n全国平均每个家庭户只有 2.52 人。\n\n消费也跟着变了：两个人的生意在退潮，取悦自己的生意在崛起。 https://t.co/ofm45lPbrp", "url": "https://x.com/TaoLongevity/status/2113449061298610608"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113175525166604289", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113622554871287808", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113570047301918720", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113703561607499776", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_211318416316768256